<title>BELGIUM: Belgian SGB to release H1 results Oct 1.</title>
<headline>Belgian SGB to release H1 results Oct 1.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian holding company Societe Generale de Belgique SA said on Tuesday it had moved the release of its 1996 interim earnings statement to October 1 from October 8.</p>
<p>A spokesman said the change was in order for the results to be included in SGB's prospectus on its planned 14,500 francs-a-share offer on Tractebel which opens on October.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
